<description>&lt;p&gt;Cameroon has received a Metal Shark patrol boat to boost maritime security while Boko Haram attacks continue, killing seven people in a village. Government forces are still targeting Anglophone separatist groups in the Northwest and Southwest regions. An explosion at a steel plant killed four people and seriously injured sixteen. Anti-femicide protests have taken place, reflecting broader social tensions. The conflict recorded 231 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxPSmhRWGphMW1mblhwY2lfQi01ZlZzTGxwM09pUVNuODlpSnpmMGQyZTZCQ1JvZHhQNHA1clVKdnBSU3VncHBLWjQxMXRQNml3V0lIX2NUMFpGWTRNczh3V2p0bW9XZDRhczN3U18ydl9XcE1mRm0zQW1RazdxWUF4c2R1WHZmWkFNa0pLYnZoS2hNaG9PQTNhVElQMjcydTRnNTNBUWtabWRWOGVSOXYxZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hawk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hawk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPb0lxbHlQVXgwX2ZQeUVqYTRSRk9ZVzY4M2FTTkNTMDBXdWdIZE51YklxdjVSalBfZlNoWWlxVEdFellGNk9iUjliU1JUcDNURFpLejN3RV8wSHJBc1NRMklod1RNN1h0YkFuanpOelhXQThzc0VGbXFhWF9EbWRvYWYwQ0VJamRSQ1pBM0xzVDU3YjJkSWk4c3d1SzZheTdTRUJpUEY4WDF0bVV2VmtRWkE4RElFMFh5?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hawk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxPTWNtQ19GSElYZk1heFpQUjF4YmE3YzZkYTYtZ1k5cEJ5ZFdLYXNwaFdSc3htN3MyOWV0cmpydFR6cHRDN2R2RGZEMkkzQmZZNlVTaGhwMWNvQXowd0hZQ1ZzYmpFM2NwQzROTjNZcUFDXzJKSmhNWWR6bnptZWJfWUViOVFsdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hawk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxOOWQwUnJTYWxMNnNYZ2pUa2dhXzFEZUpoc1lZNWFJcWphQUEtMWlXdEE2OVliemZWVkdpZ2JQQnd2S1VuYlpwSmVUemtEbks5ZXl6bnhIVHVlQm5HU1kxc3E4T2trU201TWpIaHRVbFhJV0ZrOTA0RGM4MHg0dl84ek5MRzFxcUFUZHFTbkt5UjVSVVl3dnlJOW5yNlIyMVkwSVRUdkJkTnVvWjJNSUxZ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hawk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;